review_issues.problem:
Several stated limitations and statuses that a proposal might quote, or must not overclaim, are not registered:
- curriculum uptake confined to the participating modules (bears on EO3/SC4);
- multilingual resources reviewed only for terminology and comprehensibility, with curriculum validation not established;
- no missing-outcome imputation, and no language, disability-subgroup or institution-specific estimates (bears on ME10);
- raw recordings and identifiable transcripts not publicly released, with public materials limited to recreated examples (bears on ME8 licensing);
- language-support and caption requests recorded only as service requests;
- studios remain in ordinary teaching use;
- no external research grant;
- approval KAA-EDU-2024-11 covers only the pilot, with no approval for the new evaluation.
